TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-2507.19896v1
AU  - Kostiantyn Tolmachov, Heorhii Zhylinskyi
TI  - Generalized Markov traces and Jucys-Murphy elements
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.19896
AB  - We give a simple construction of Markov traces for Iwahori-Hecke algebras associated with infinite series of crystallographic Coxeter groups. In types B and D it is new, and generalizes a known construction in type A employing symmetric polynomials in multiplicative Jucys-Murphy elements.
ER  - 
